  "content": "# Beta 1.7.3 次元\n\nBeta 1.7.3 Dimension 模組在獨立的次元中加入了 Beta 1.7.3 世界生成選項。\n\n![預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ItO3yfpJ/images/d7f108cab45e5877d400eea4a863ddc486c6b53f.jpeg)\n\n## 使用方法\n\n要進入 Beta 1.7.3 次元，請使用黑曜石框架在右上角和左下角放置粗泥土，左上角和右下角放置鵝卵石來製作傳送門：\n\n![Beta 1.7.3 次元傳送門](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/97fc9efd7f3c662a2fc2b25f3b2daa8daf069a98.png)\n\n## 相容性\n\n- [乘客傳送門修復](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- **Create** 擴充套件：[Create：Portal 整合](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## 問題\n\n目前沒有報告新的相容性或錯誤問題。請於 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/issues) 回報以便進行修復。\n\n## 支援\n\n🟩 26.1-26.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1\n\n🟩 受支援  \n🟥 已移除支援  \n🟨 開發中  \n🟪 考慮中  \n\n## 注意事項\n\n歡迎在 modpack、影片、串流媒體或類似媒體中使用此模組。若喜歡此 mod，希望能獲得您的財務支持，我將非常感謝。\n\n<details>\n<summary>為什麼不在 CF？</summary>\n\n![為什麼不在 CF 的原因](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d52445208db9028f61d4bb81ccb82243fc705158.png)\n\n</details>\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上看到我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"於 CurseForge 上提供\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 YouTube 觀看我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Discord 與我聊天\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"透過 Patreon 支持我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"透過 Ko-fi 支持我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"透過 Saweria 支持我\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionfixer\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionlink\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/worldportal\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"World Portal\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanillaworld\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ morecatvariants\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passengersportalfix\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passengers Portal Fix\"></a>\n  <a href=\"